spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/PLAN.md-4-Goal: In the production messaging drawer, no message a user 
sends is lost or duplicated across network and Realtime outages, reloads, several tabs, account changes, and several 
devices; typing, unread/read state, and @mention notifications stay live and correct; and messaging health is 
observable through redacted logs — without regressing existing messaging.
