spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/SPEC.md-61-
spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/SPEC.md-62-### Out of scope
spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/SPEC.md-63-- Loading the application while offline (service worker / 
