spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/SPEC.md-64-- Queuing attachments or voice notes (they keep the Phase 4 
behavior).
spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/SPEC.md-65-- Editing a pending message (cancel and rewrite instead).
spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/SPEC.md-66-- Web Push / notifications with the browser or tab closed; 
