notification preference; scrolling to the message on notification click.
spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/SPEC.md-68-- Draft persistence; live sync of stars.
spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/SPEC.md:69:- Usage/engagement metrics; a metrics UI or external analytics 
service.
spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/SPEC.md-70-- Immediate revocation of typing signals for a tampered client 
of a removed member (accepted residual risk ≤ access-token lifetime, D3).
spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/SPEC.md-71-- Safari and mobile browsers; drawer layout below ~400 px.
spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/SPEC.md-72-- Other Phase 4 follow-ups: pending-upload cap, toaster 
