spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/SPEC.md-311-- Type-check, lint, build, integration, E2E, and the 
regression suite pass; new E2E specs passed 3 consecutive runs in Chrome and Edge; Firefox verification recorded.
spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/SPEC.md-312-- Phase-end migrations applied online with authorization, 
readback, and smoke recorded (AC-034).
spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/SPEC.md-313-- Owner final test of the new app against the online database 
with two accounts.
spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/SPEC.md-314-- Hand-off states the application is ready to deploy after the 
migrations; deployment is performed by the owner.
spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/SPEC.md-315-
