and pass a send/read/unread smoke, including legacy unkeyed writes (hosted build) and keyed text, attachment, voice, 
and failed-send retry (Phase 4 build), plus new direct and room conversation creation, authorized room joining, 
preferences, archive, and read (T28 contracts) on both builds, and — if the hosted ref is between 2026-02-09 and 
2026-02-23 (TRACK T3) — the Knock response log message; every migration has recorded rollback SQL and a row in 
MIGRATIONS-PENDENTES.md.
